reviews.review:
Really poor performance. I played elden ring on launch with almost constant 60fps on 1440p. This game constatly drops bellow 45fps on 720p; 
 the games is incredible but it is so frutrating to play a pixelated slideshow. The only reason i played it for this long is simply because i played with a friend. Absolutly would refound it if a could; wich sucks cus I really adore shooters and the cryptic nature of souls like.
I do not recomend it to anyone with a rtx 3060, anything above that go ahead and buy it; it is a fantastic game.
